{"id": 64, "ts": 1780592735.0804098, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 3, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I appreciate Sarah\u2019s shift toward Candidate\u202fB based on the solid reliability and stress\u2011resilience evidence. However, I remain convinced that Candidate\u202fC is the stronger overall fit. C\u2019s proven ability to make quick, correct decisions and stay calm in a crisis directly addresses the most safety\u2011critical aspects of long\u2011haul operations, and his positive crew atmosphere suggests good cooperation despite his communication style. While we lack concrete data on his attention to detail and role\u2011maturity, those gaps are less immediately disqualifying than B\u2019s documented interpersonal issues\u2014namely the nasty remarks and weak memory for numbers\u2014which could undermine crew coordination and operational accuracy. In my view, C\u2019s demonstrated decision quality and composure outweigh the manageable concerns, so I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fC."}
